{"id":"n51da2e7f12","headline":"Sensex, Nifty trim losses as banking stocks offset IT rout, focus shifts to RBI MPC meeting","summary":"The Sensex and Nifty recovered part of their losses as banking stocks rallied and offset an IT sector sell-off. Investors are now focusing on the upcoming RBI monetary policy committee meeting.","why":"The Sensex and Nifty are the benchmark indices of Indian equities, tracking large listed companies on the BSE and NSE. Monetary policy decisions by the RBI influence bank stocks and broader market sentiment.","category":"markets","event_type":"rates","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"BusinessLine","url":"https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/sensex-nifty-trim-losses-as-banking-stocks-offset-it-rout-focus-shifts-to-rbi-mpc-meeting/article71056681.ece"},"sources":[{"name":"BusinessLine","url":"https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/sensex-nifty-trim-losses-as-banking-stocks-offset-it-rout-focus-shifts-to-rbi-mpc-meeting/article71056681.ece"}],"published_at":"2026-06-03T11:15:28Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:20:22Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"e662ffbaebaeecfd","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:20:22Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-03T11:15:28Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-03T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"KS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-market-trading-screen-6693060.jpg","alt":"stock market trading screen (illustration)","credit":"sergeitokmakov","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/stock-mark